{"content":[{"signature":"","thinking":"\nThe task is DATA-HDB-01, which asks me to implement a `solve(case)` function that computes the Minimum Spanning Tree (MST) of a mutual reachability graph used in HDBSCAN.\n\nIn HDBSCAN, the mutual reachability distance between two points u and v is:\n`mreach(u, v) = max(core_distance(u), core_distance(v), distance(u, v))`\n\nThe MST is computed on this mutual reachability graph.\n\nLet me implement Kruskal's algorithm:\n\n1. Compute mutual reachability distances for all edges\n2. Sort edges by mutual reachability distance\n3. Apply Kruskal's algorithm with union-find to get MST\n4. Return mst_edges (list of [node1, node2, weight] triples) and total_weight\n\nLet me verify with the first fixture:\n- nodes: p0, p1, p2, p3, p4\n- core_distances: p0=0.23243377, p1=0.50398147, p2=0.55673811, p3=0.66828478, p4=0.43968915\n\nFor each edge, compute mutual reachability:\n- p0-p1: max(0.23243377, 0.50398147, 0.89672724) = 0.89672724\n- p0-p2: max(0.23243377, 0.55673811, 0.73968893) = 0.73968893\n- p0-p3: max(0.23243377, 0.66828478, 0.77270596) = 0.77270596\n- p0-p4: max(0.23243377, 0.43968915, 0.87376631) = 0.87376631\n- p1-p2: max(0.50398147, 0.55673811, 1.08418122) = 1.08418122\n- p1-p3: max(0.50398147, 0.66828478, 0.82719237) = 0.82719237\n- p1-p4: max(0.50398147, 0.43968915, 0.61293041) = 0.61293041\n- p2-p3: max(0.55673811, 0.66828478, 1.00286271) = 1.00286271\n- p2-p4: max(0.55673811, 0.43968915, 0.5322912) = 0.55673811\n- p3-p4: max(0.66828478, 0.43968915, 0.51351834) = 0.66828478\n\nSorted:\n- p2-p4: 0.55673811\n- p3-p4: 0.66828478\n- p1-p4: 0.61293041\n- p0-p2: 0.73968893\n- p0-p3: 0.77270596\n- p1-p3: 0.82719237\n- p0-p4: 0.87376631\n- p0-p1: 0.89672724\n- p2-p3: 1.00286271\n- p1-p2: 1.08418122\n\nWait let me re-sort:\n0.55673811 (p2-p4)\n0.61293041 (p1-p4)\n0.66828478 (p3-p4)\n0.73968893 (p0-p2)\n0.77270596 (p0-p3)\n0.82719237 (p1-p3)\n0.87376631 (p0-p4)\n0.89672724 (p0-p1)\n1.00286271 (p2-p3)\n1.08418122 (p1-p2)\n\nKruskal's:\n1. p2-p4: 0.55673811 → add (components: {p2,p4}, {p0}, {p1}, {p3})\n2. p1-p4: 0.61293041 → add (components: {p1,p2,p4}, {p0}, {p3})\n3. p3-p4: 0.66828478 → add (components: {p1,p2,p3,p4}, {p0})\n4. p0-p2: 0.73968893 → add (components: {p0,p1,p2,p3,p4}) → MST complete\n\nMST edges: [p2,p4,0.55673811], [p1,p4,0.61293041], [p3,p4,0.66828478], [p0,p2,0.73968893]\nTotal weight: 0.55673811 + 0.61293041 + 0.66828478 + 0.73968893 = 2.57764223\n\nNow let me write the implementation:\n\n```python\ndef solve(case):\n    nodes = case[\"nodes\"]\n    core_distance = case[\"core_distance\"]\n    distances = case[\"distances\"]\n    \n    # Compute mutual reachability distances\n    mreach_edges = []\n    for u, v, d in distances:\n        mreach = max(core_distance[u], core_distance[v], d)\n        mreach_edges.append((u, v, mreach))\n    \n    # Sort by mutual reachability distance\n    mreach_edges.sort(key=lambda e: e[2])\n    \n    # Kruskal's algorithm with union-find\n    parent = {n: n for n in nodes}\n    rank = {n: 0 for n in nodes}\n    \n    def find(x):\n        while parent[x] != x:\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\n            x = parent[x]\n        return x\n    \n    def union(x, y):\n        rx, ry = find(x), find(y)\n        if rx == ry:\n            return False\n        if rank[rx] \u003c rank[ry]:\n            rx, ry = ry, rx\n        parent[ry] = rx\n        if rank[rx] == rank[ry]:\n            rank[rx] += 1\n        return True\n    \n    mst_edges = []\n    total_weight = 0.0\n    \n    for u, v, w in mreach_edges:\n        if union(u, v):\n            mst_edges.append([u, v, w])\n            total_weight += w\n            if len(mst_edges) == len(nodes) - 1:\n                break\n    \n    return {\n        \"mst_edges\": mst_edges,\n        \"total_weight\": total_weight\n    }\n```\n\nThis looks correct. Now I need to format it as the required JSON output with `implementation` key.\n","type":"thinking"},{"text":"{\"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    nodes = case[\\\"nodes\\\"]\\n    core_distance = case[\\\"core_distance\\\"]\\n    distances = case[\\\"distances\\\"]\\n\\n    # Compute mutual reachability distance for each edge:\\n    # mreach(u,v) = max(core_dist(u), core_dist(v), dist(u,v))\\n    mreach_edges = []\\n    for u, v, d in distances:\\n        mreach = max(core_distance[u], core_distance[v], d)\\n        mreach_edges.append((u, v, mreach))\\n\\n    # Sort edges by mutual reachability distance (Kruskal's)\\n    mreach_edges.sort(key=lambda e: e[2])\\n\\n    # Union-Find for Kruskal's MST\\n    parent = {n: n for n in nodes}\\n    rank = {n: 0 for n in nodes}\\n\\n    def find(x):\\n        while parent[x] != x:\\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\\n            x = parent[x]\\n        return x\\n\\n    def union(x, y):\\n        rx, ry = find(x), find(y)\\n        if rx == ry:\\n            return False\\n        if rank[rx] \u003c rank[ry]:\\n            rx, ry = ry, rx\\n        parent[ry] = rx\\n        if rank[rx] == rank[ry]:\\n            rank[rx] += 1\\n        return True\\n\\n    mst_edges = []\\n    total_weight = 0.0\\n\\n    for u, v, w in mreach_edges:\\n        if union(u, v):\\n            mst_edges.append([u, v, w])\\n            total_weight += w\\n            if len(mst_edges) == len(nodes) - 1:\\n                break\\n\\n    return {\\n        \\\"mst_edges\\\": mst_edges,\\n        \\\"total_weight\\\": total_weight\\n    }\\n\"}","type":"text"}],"id":"msg_01ULl1Q7BRv95fesByFHEP4g","model":"claude-opus-4-7","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2040},"cache_creation_input_tokens":2040,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"inference_geo":"not_available","input_tokens":97,"output_tokens":2128,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1645},"service_tier":"standard"}}